add('Theorem51','5.6','208–209',[81],r'''Theorem 5.1 Let $H(q,p)$ and $\widetilde H(q,p)=H(q,p)+\varepsilon\eta(q,p)$ be two Hamiltonian functions. Suppose the energy surface $\Sigma_E=\{(q,p)\mid H(q,p)=E\}$ to be compact and define the perturbed energy surface by $\widetilde\Sigma_E=\{(q,p)\mid\widetilde H(q,p)=E\}$, also assumed compact.
Suppose that $w$ is an arbitrary smooth vector field such that $w\cdot\nabla H\ne0$ on $\Sigma_E$. Then the perturbation of the microcanonical average of a smooth function $g$ is given by
\[\operatorname{Av}_{H=E}(g)-\operatorname{Av}_{\widetilde H=E}(g)=\operatorname{Av}_{\widetilde H=E}(\nabla\cdot gu)-\operatorname{Av}_{\widetilde H=E}(g)\operatorname{Av}_{\widetilde H=E}(\nabla\cdot u)+O(\varepsilon^2),\]
where $u=\varepsilon\eta w/(w\cdot\nabla H)$.''',proposition('theorem51_statement'),kind='theorem',label='Theorem 5.1',extra=['[EXTRA]实际C∞和regularEnergy含梯度非零及raw总质量有限正；补统一紧能量带与其上分母不为零，量化完整O(ε²)平均差。不只陈述分母下界，不将校正关系作前提。'],missing='缺实际曲面扰动/coarea、微正则加权测度渐近与平均商展开；用户禁止建设大型微正则理论，保留完整sorry。')
